    {
      "subId": "7217202",
      "subQuestName": "进入鹤观，寻找阿瑠",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721720201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721720201": {
            "id": "721720201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "牧梨",
            "text": "…真羡慕阿瑠哪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720202"
            ]
          },
          "721720202": {
            "id": "721720202",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "伊部",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720203"
            ]
          },
          "721720203": {
            "id": "721720203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "伊部",
            "text": "别说傻话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720204"
            ]
          },
          "721720204": {
            "id": "721720204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "牧梨",
            "text": "嗯。对不起。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720205"
            ]
          },
          "721720205": {
            "id": "721720205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "伊部",
            "text": "不过，更让我不高兴的是，为什么干活的只有我？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720206"
            ]
          },
          "721720206": {
            "id": "721720206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是伊部和牧梨。好像，是在供奉栖木。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720207"
            ]
          },
          "721720207": {
            "id": "721720207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，我想起来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720210"
            ]
          },
          "721720210": {
            "id": "721720210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "他们说过，栖木是祭典的关键。所以，一定要好好供奉、保护栖木。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720211"
            ]
          },
          "721720211": {
            "id": "721720211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那么，如果栖木被破坏了，那祭典是不是就进行不下去了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720212"
            ]
          },
          "721720212": {
            "id": "721720212",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "但是是过去的幻影…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720213"
            ]
          },
          "721720213": {
            "id": "721720213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "如果说…就算是这样，那我们也不能不试一试。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720214"
            ]
          },
          "721720214": {
            "id": "721720214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "既然什么雷鸟、什么栖木对鹤观的人这么重要，那就要试一试才行！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720215"
            ]
          },
          "721720215": {
            "id": "721720215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "里面不是说有雷鸟的力量吗？说不定，他们会有什么反应…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217225",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721721401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721721401": {
            "id": "721721401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "阿瑠不在…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721402"
            ]
          },
          "721721402": {
            "id": "721721402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "可能在更深处。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721403"
            ]
          },
          "721721403": {
            "id": "721721403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "要快点找到他，不然的话…鹤观的人就会把他献给雷鸟了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721404"
            ]
          },
          "721721404": {
            "id": "721721404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "按照阿釜的说法…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721405"
            ]
          },
          "721721405": {
            "id": "721721405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，我知道，鹤观现在发生的事情，都是会不断重复的幻影。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721406"
            ]
          },
          "721721406": {
            "id": "721721406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但是，如果是这样的话，那阿瑠也会不断重复被献给雷鸟。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721407"
            ]
          },
          "721721407": {
            "id": "721721407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这样的话，不是很可怜吗？所以，我们一定要帮助阿瑠。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721408"
            ]
          },
          "721721408": {
            "id": "721721408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们出发吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721409"
            ]
          },
          "721721409": {
            "id": "721721409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
